WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.360 --> 01:41.820
[Episode 33]

3
01:57.040 --> 01:59.866
Ping Jun, you're here.

4
02:02.080 --> 02:04.200
Do you remember this place?

5
02:04.200 --> 02:08.399
When we were little, we used to play here all the time.

6
02:12.880 --> 02:17.650
Your note said you had news regarding Chang Xuan's safety.

7
02:17.650 --> 02:19.000
What is it?

8
02:25.400 --> 02:27.259
You're so concerned about him.

9
02:27.880 --> 02:30.480
If it weren't for Yu Chang Xuan,

10
02:30.480 --> 02:33.680
we'd never have the chance to talk, right?

11
02:34.659 --> 02:36.000
So...

12
02:37.040 --> 02:41.246
what happened to Chang Xuan was your doing?

13
02:44.039 --> 02:45.159
Yes.

14
02:46.080 --> 02:47.426
So what?

15
02:49.120 --> 02:51.476
Do you know what I've been through all these years?

16
02:51.476 --> 02:54.984
After the hut caught fire, I rushed in to save you,

17
02:54.984 --> 02:57.110
but Yu Chang Xuan's soldiers blocked me.

18
02:57.110 --> 02:59.160
They pushed me off the cliff.

19
02:59.160 --> 03:03.684
When I woke up, I was already in a labor camp.

20
03:03.684 --> 03:06.184
That was no place for a human being.

21
03:07.360 --> 03:09.360
Life was cheap there.

22
03:09.360 --> 03:11.617
It was a living hell.

23
03:11.617 --> 03:17.879
My leg... was ruined there.

24
03:19.280 --> 03:20.701
For those two years,

25
03:23.240 --> 03:26.840
I had no choice but to endure it.

26
03:27.539 --> 03:30.259
I had only one thought.

27
03:30.259 --> 03:32.620
To get out alive and find you.

28
03:36.640 --> 03:39.440
When I finally escaped that hellhole,

29
03:40.960 --> 03:44.253
you had already become Yu Chang Xuan's wife.

30
03:45.360 --> 03:47.879
That taught me a lesson.

31
03:47.879 --> 03:50.360
In these cruel, chaotic times,

32
03:51.360 --> 03:56.460
without power, you won't even have the right to protect anyone.

33
03:57.920 --> 04:03.713
So I fought my way up, climbing all the way to where I am today.

34
04:05.039 --> 04:07.280
Only then could I stand before you.

35
04:11.400 --> 04:12.800
Mr. Jiang.

36
04:17.040 --> 04:18.333
Xue Ting.

37
04:19.120 --> 04:24.093
Perhaps we used to be everything to each other.

38
04:24.680 --> 04:30.806
But still, what happened to you is because of me and Chang Xuan.

39
04:33.600 --> 04:35.040
So...

40
04:36.899 --> 04:38.720
I apologize to you on his behalf.

41
04:38.720 --> 04:41.361
In what capacity are you apologizing for him?

42
04:42.680 --> 04:48.120
If it weren't for Yu Chang Xuan, we wouldn't be in this situation today.

43
04:48.120 --> 04:50.686
Why are you still so stubborn?

44
04:53.680 --> 04:55.346
Ping Jun.

45
04:55.346 --> 04:57.440
I have the power to protect you now.

46
04:57.440 --> 05:00.233
Leave him and come with me.

47
05:04.080 --> 05:05.380
Mr. Jiang.

48
05:06.160 --> 05:08.719
Tao Zi Yi is your fiancée.

49
05:09.760 --> 05:11.480
Ping Jun.

50
05:11.480 --> 05:13.733
My relationship with her is not what it seems.

51
05:13.733 --> 05:17.000
This engagement is purely a matter of mutual benefit.

52
05:17.000 --> 05:18.530
A calculation of interests.

53
05:18.530 --> 05:21.093
Using marriage to achieve your own goals.

54
05:21.920 --> 05:23.220
Mr. Jiang,

55
05:23.800 --> 05:29.540
how is what you're doing any different from the Yu Chang Xuan you think he is?

56
05:33.760 --> 05:35.401
You're comparing me to him?

57
05:36.280 --> 05:38.139
How can he even compare to me?

58
05:39.740 --> 05:45.680
Perhaps Yu Chang Xuan did make many mistakes in the past.

59
05:46.560 --> 05:49.220
But while I was unconscious,

60
05:49.220 --> 05:53.420
he stayed by my side and took care of me.

61
05:56.520 --> 05:58.500
After I woke up,

62
05:59.480 --> 06:03.690
he protected me and kept me company.

63
06:03.690 --> 06:08.540
During that time, I never truly understood my feelings for him.

64
06:08.540 --> 06:11.000
I turned him down time and again,

65
06:13.320 --> 06:15.859
but he never gave up on me.

66
06:17.560 --> 06:23.320
And now, he's the one in my heart.

67
06:24.639 --> 06:26.240
The one and only.

68
06:35.100 --> 06:36.920
Have you really thought it through?

69
06:39.939 --> 06:42.633
Yu Chang Xuan is doomed this time.

70
06:43.680 --> 06:46.399
Are you sure you want to stay with a dead man?

71
06:47.920 --> 06:49.839
I've already thought it through.

72
06:50.760 --> 06:54.620
Wherever he is, I'll be there.

73
06:56.080 --> 07:01.099
Whether he's alive or dead, I'll be with him.

74
07:49.560 --> 07:54.720
[Sujing Military Court]

75
07:59.320 --> 08:01.700
Alright. Quiet down, everyone.

76
08:03.156 --> 08:07.480
Commissioner Gao was killed in Nanhuai.

77
08:07.480 --> 08:11.800
I feel deeply grieved by his death.

78
08:11.800 --> 08:15.240
This is a serious and complex case.

79
08:15.240 --> 08:19.406
I will preside over the trial today.

80
08:20.240 --> 08:21.933
Please rest assured.

81
08:21.933 --> 08:26.066
Justice will be served in Sujing.

82
08:29.680 --> 08:34.220
Governor Chu, the prosecution has submitted all the evidence.

83
08:34.220 --> 08:37.659
The witness has also testified.

84
08:38.440 --> 08:43.344
Governor, what Director Jiang said is just his side of the story.

85
08:43.344 --> 08:47.000
Commissioner Gao and I had no conflict of interest.

86
08:47.000 --> 08:49.840
I had no motive to kill him.

87
08:49.840 --> 08:52.630
Commissioner Gao was ordered to take over the Arsenal.

88
08:52.630 --> 08:57.680
On that very day, many people saw you two having a heated argument.

89
08:57.680 --> 09:00.060
Isn't that your motive for murder?

90
09:00.680 --> 09:06.480
Who instructed you to carry out the murder?

91
09:06.480 --> 09:08.720
Tell us everything in detail.

92
09:08.720 --> 09:11.299
Your Honor, it was him.

93
09:11.299 --> 09:12.960
Deputy Commander Yu gave me the order.

94
09:12.960 --> 09:14.640
He refused to hand over the Arsenal,

95
09:14.640 --> 09:18.360
so he sent me to plant explosives in Commissioner Gao's car.

96
09:18.360 --> 09:19.840
I confess to all charges.

97
09:19.840 --> 09:22.620
I beg the court for leniency.

98
09:29.520 --> 09:33.080
Governor, the evidence is now conclusive.

99
09:33.080 --> 09:36.200
Deputy Commander Yu assassinated Commissioner Gao.

100
09:36.200 --> 09:39.139
His crime is unforgivable.

101
09:41.280 --> 09:45.559
Deputy Commander Yu, what do you have to say for yourself?

102
09:45.559 --> 09:46.860
Governor.

103
09:47.759 --> 09:49.799
As Director Jiang said,

104
09:51.059 --> 09:53.580
Commissioner Gao and I did argue.

105
09:53.580 --> 09:59.666
But we settled it in private and signed an agreement.

106
10:14.040 --> 10:19.250
The agreement clearly states that after inspecting the Nanhuai Arsenal,

107
10:19.250 --> 10:21.820
Commissioner Gao found its technology advanced.

108
10:21.820 --> 10:26.539
[Acting Manager: Yu Chang Xuan] A hasty takeover could disrupt production.

109
10:26.539 --> 10:30.539
He therefore decided that we'd continue to manage it.

110
10:30.539 --> 10:33.960
All production will go to the Central Army first.

111
10:33.960 --> 10:39.039
And we will report to him on a monthly basis.

112
10:41.000 --> 10:42.320
It's all confirmed.

113
10:42.320 --> 10:44.440
- They settled it? - They settled it?

114
10:44.440 --> 10:46.786
- Then there's no motive for murder. - Exactly.

115
10:51.960 --> 10:54.746
- It seems there's a turn of events. - That's right.

116
11:01.440 --> 11:03.659
Commissioner Gao is already dead.

117
11:03.659 --> 11:08.480
Who can say for sure if the agreement is real?

118
11:11.640 --> 11:16.740
Since Director Jiang doubts the authenticity of this agreement,

119
11:16.740 --> 11:21.120
I request that the court summon a key witness.

120
11:26.720 --> 11:28.039
Granted.

121
11:40.700 --> 11:42.360
Who is this?

122
11:55.259 --> 11:57.220
How is Commissioner Gao still alive?

123
11:57.220 --> 12:00.019
- Commissioner Gao is alive? - He's not dead!

124
12:09.640 --> 12:11.379
- What's going on? - He's alive?

125
12:11.379 --> 12:13.000
- What's happening? - What?

126
12:28.720 --> 12:32.913
Commissioner Gao, you're safe and sound.

127
12:33.659 --> 12:35.320
Commissioner Gao.

128
12:35.320 --> 12:36.906
What a relief.

129
12:37.639 --> 12:39.659
What exactly is going on?

130
12:40.899 --> 12:46.720
Everyone, I, Gao Ping, can confirm that I personally signed and sealed

131
12:46.720 --> 12:52.360
the agreement Deputy Commander Yu submitted.

132
12:52.360 --> 12:53.980
It is absolutely genuine.

133
12:53.980 --> 12:57.880
It's also true that I was attacked in Nanhuai.

134
12:57.880 --> 13:03.060
If Deputy Commander Yu hadn't foreseen it and secretly sent men to protect me,

135
13:03.060 --> 13:07.900
I would have become a wandering ghost.

136
13:09.480 --> 13:11.440
Chang Xuan, we've checked.

137
13:11.440 --> 13:14.426
Gao Ping's deficit on the Jingnan Railway is a bottomless pit.

138
13:14.426 --> 13:17.320
But the Central Government still promoted him and granted him privileges.

139
13:17.320 --> 13:18.773
It's very unusual.

140
13:20.580 --> 13:21.980
Commissioner Gao.

141
13:23.740 --> 13:26.960
You know your current situation in the Central Government well.

142
13:27.720 --> 13:32.539
The Jingnan Railway matter is enough to have you executed ten times.

143
13:32.539 --> 13:35.040
You've long been a discarded pawn.

144
13:35.040 --> 13:38.560
Why did they suddenly award you property,

145
13:38.560 --> 13:43.093
settle your son, and entrust you with such a vital task?

146
13:44.400 --> 13:48.780
Doesn't this look like a lavish last meal before execution?

147
13:50.120 --> 13:53.386
Yu Chang Xuan, stop your alarmist talk.

148
13:56.360 --> 14:01.539
They sent you to Nanhuai not only to take over the Arsenal,

149
14:02.120 --> 14:07.540
but to use your death to frame me for being disloyal to the Central Government.

150
14:08.480 --> 14:11.100
That's why they arranged your affairs in advance.

151
14:14.360 --> 14:17.659
Trust me, and I can keep you alive.

152
14:17.659 --> 14:21.733
If you don't, you're welcome to try your luck.

153
14:35.039 --> 14:39.840
Commissioner Gao, do you believe Deputy Commander Yu now?

154
14:50.100 --> 14:52.500
- Who would've thought? - Who knew?

155
14:56.720 --> 15:00.730
Now, with Director Jiang's so-called evidence

156
15:00.730 --> 15:03.380
and the Governor's promise of justice,

157
15:04.240 --> 15:06.586
can I finally be cleared of all charges?

158
15:15.240 --> 15:18.100
Now, you can tell us.

159
15:19.440 --> 15:23.339
Who made you frame me?

160
15:39.360 --> 15:43.240
I killed Gao for personal reasons.

161
15:43.240 --> 15:47.240
He seized my family's land and drove my parents to their deaths.

162
15:47.240 --> 15:51.600
I intended to use your conflict with Gao to frame you.

163
15:51.600 --> 15:55.860
But now that the plan has failed, I have nothing more to say.

164
16:00.460 --> 16:02.000
Do you know

165
16:03.320 --> 16:07.539
the consequences of refusing to confess?

166
16:07.539 --> 16:09.759
I'm telling the truth.

167
16:09.759 --> 16:11.860
No one manipulated me.

168
16:11.860 --> 16:15.620
I did everything on my own.

169
16:29.000 --> 16:30.760
This is quite sudden.

170
16:30.760 --> 16:34.360
Take him away and keep a close watch.

171
16:34.360 --> 16:36.697
Interrogate him thoroughly later.

172
16:36.697 --> 16:37.960
Yes, sir.

173
16:37.960 --> 16:38.960
Move.

174
16:51.759 --> 16:53.340
What's going on?

175
16:53.340 --> 16:55.506
- What happened? - Why were there gunshots?

176
16:58.720 --> 17:02.726
Governor Chu, the suspect snatched a gun and shot himself.

177
17:03.800 --> 17:05.760
- You're dismissed. - How is that possible?

178
17:05.760 --> 17:07.700
- How could this happen? - To avoid punishment?

179
17:07.700 --> 17:09.740
He died right after confessing.

180
17:21.080 --> 17:25.316
Director, as you instructed, we've detained his wife and child.

181
17:25.316 --> 17:28.040
But is this really necessary?

182
17:28.040 --> 17:30.520
Yu Chang Xuan is already in prison.

183
17:30.520 --> 17:32.840
Your plan has succeeded.

184
17:32.840 --> 17:37.164
Don't jump to conclusions until the very end.

185
17:37.164 --> 17:42.013
We must have a backup plan to prevent any unforeseen trouble.

186
18:03.386 --> 18:04.520
Deputy Commander Yu.

187
18:04.520 --> 18:06.040
That gentleman has arrived.

188
18:16.600 --> 18:17.880
Deputy Commander Yu.

189
18:17.880 --> 18:19.450
It is an honor to meet you.

190
18:19.450 --> 18:24.346
Someone asked me to deliver a personal letter to you.

191
18:28.960 --> 18:32.720
I have come here on behalf of the Southern Government.

192
18:32.720 --> 18:36.124
We've long admired your achievements in Nanhuai.

193
18:36.124 --> 18:39.886
We also feel deeply indignant about your recent ordeal.

194
18:43.960 --> 18:48.200
The Central Government has lost its way and the people's support.

195
18:48.200 --> 18:52.257
A fine bird chooses the right tree, and a wise official chooses the right master.

196
18:52.257 --> 18:54.320
The Southern Government sincerely hopes

197
18:54.320 --> 18:58.339
that you will go with the tide, change your allegiance,

198
18:58.339 --> 19:03.233
and join us in building a truly unified China.

199
19:06.080 --> 19:08.840
You don't have to answer me right away.

200
19:09.600 --> 19:12.866
We will await your reply.

201
19:39.280 --> 19:45.246
It seems the Southern Government is sincere about winning you over.

202
19:46.400 --> 19:48.440
The North and South are at a standoff.

203
19:49.440 --> 19:51.126
If I make a move,

204
19:52.760 --> 19:55.673
Nanhuai will become a target for all sides.

205
19:57.240 --> 20:01.666
The lives of hundreds of thousands are not mine to gamble with.

206
20:02.560 --> 20:07.503
The current situation is volatile, with wars breaking out everywhere.

207
20:07.503 --> 20:13.486
Nanhuai City has managed to keep the peace.

208
20:15.600 --> 20:17.360
It is truly a rare feat.

209
20:19.080 --> 20:20.853
I understand your dilemma.

210
20:22.080 --> 20:27.400
But what I must protect shouldn't be just one city.

211
20:32.760 --> 20:35.259
The Southern Government is divided.

212
20:35.259 --> 20:37.559
Some are truly for the country and people,

213
20:38.440 --> 20:44.493
while others seek fame and pursue their own interests.

214
20:47.760 --> 20:52.921
Ultimately, you'll have to weigh the stakes yourself.

215
20:54.240 --> 20:57.820
This path is yours to choose.

216
21:18.520 --> 21:20.400
Master Jin, you have a letter.

217
21:20.400 --> 21:21.753
It's from Guangzhou.

218
21:34.640 --> 21:37.950
Dear Zhong Fang, I hope this letter finds you well.

219
21:37.950 --> 21:41.704
The Kuomintang and the Communist Party may not be able to cooperate.

220
21:41.704 --> 21:44.644
We'll escort our comrades to Hong Kong first.

221
21:44.644 --> 21:48.520
When I return, I'll explain everything to you in detail.

222
21:48.520 --> 21:49.841
Wen Bo.

223
22:02.120 --> 22:04.960
Our comrades in Guangdong have already arrived in Hong Kong.

224
22:04.960 --> 22:07.364
We've also moved to Changling for now.

225
22:07.364 --> 22:10.047
The leadership has set up a contact point in Siping.

226
22:10.047 --> 22:11.460
[Siping Town, Changling County] Don't worry, comrades.

227
22:11.460 --> 22:13.906
We'll get you out of the city safely today.

228
22:17.280 --> 22:19.480
The situation has been tense lately.

229
22:19.480 --> 22:21.884
They maintain cooperation on the surface,

230
22:21.884 --> 22:24.725
but they're arresting and killing our comrades behind our backs.

231
22:26.640 --> 22:27.920
Don't worry.

232
22:27.920 --> 22:30.644
Someone will wait for you at the station in Tianjin.

233
22:30.644 --> 22:33.160
They'll help you board the ship to Hong Kong.

234
22:33.160 --> 22:34.326
Thank you.

235
22:53.640 --> 22:55.279
Who's in the car?

236
22:55.279 --> 22:57.160
Get out for inspection.

237
22:59.240 --> 23:02.333
How dare you talk to me like that?

238
23:09.360 --> 23:11.440
[Exit Pass]

239
23:12.240 --> 23:13.839
Did you see that clearly?

240
23:15.120 --> 23:16.606
Get out of the way.

241
23:21.720 --> 23:22.960
Let them through.

242
23:50.560 --> 23:54.079
Lady Ping Jun, these are the candied kumquats you wanted, the ones Miss Jin Xuan had.

243
23:54.079 --> 23:55.673
I brought some from the kitchen.

244
23:57.120 --> 23:58.773
Just in time.

245
24:12.000 --> 24:14.833
Lady Ping Jun, are you feeling unwell again?

246
24:15.866 --> 24:18.240
You've been tired lately.

247
24:18.240 --> 24:20.720
And you can't stand greasy food.

248
24:20.720 --> 24:22.206
Could it be...

249
24:23.760 --> 24:25.586
Could it be that you're pregnant?

250
24:47.960 --> 24:50.360
Commander-in-Chief, Deputy Commander.

251
24:50.360 --> 24:52.050
It's been a long time.

252
24:52.050 --> 24:58.580
The Tokyo Military Department has long admired your skills in commanding troops.

253
24:59.720 --> 25:02.521
We're willing to provide the Yu Army

254
25:03.200 --> 25:10.117
with financial support and the latest military equipment

255
25:10.117 --> 25:12.120
to help the Yu family

256
25:12.120 --> 25:17.480
take control of Sujing as soon as possible.

257
25:18.560 --> 25:19.746
Of course,

258
25:20.520 --> 25:26.240
the Empire also hopes that both sides will benefit mutually.

259
25:26.240 --> 25:28.773
Only then can this partnership endure.

260
25:30.560 --> 25:34.330
Thank you, Mr. Takahashi, for your kind offer.

261
25:34.330 --> 25:38.657
The Yu family only seeks to ensure regional peace

262
25:38.657 --> 25:41.752
so the people can live in prosperity.

263
25:41.752 --> 25:46.800
Any aid that brings Nanhuai stability and prosperity

264
25:46.800 --> 25:48.937
is certainly welcome.

265
25:48.937 --> 25:54.010
But taking control of Sujing is far too burdensome.

266
25:54.010 --> 25:58.200
I'm afraid we can't take that on.

267
25:58.200 --> 26:01.020
Please do not mention it again.

268
26:09.040 --> 26:13.960
This orchid is elegant and refined, with an extraordinary character.

269
26:13.960 --> 26:16.597
I know this is a big ask, but could you give it to me?

270
26:16.597 --> 26:21.960
When I return to Japan, I'll hire the best gardener

271
26:21.960 --> 26:26.680
to transplant this orchid into my garden.

272
26:28.240 --> 26:29.733
Mr. Takahashi.

273
26:30.640 --> 26:32.760
I'm afraid I'll have to disappoint you.

274
26:33.720 --> 26:36.861
Deputy Commander, why do you say that?

275
26:37.440 --> 26:39.550
This is an orchid from Nanhuai.

276
26:39.550 --> 26:41.150
Deeply rooted in its native soil.

277
26:43.200 --> 26:46.120
Only here can such elegant flowers bloom.

278
26:46.120 --> 26:50.330
If uprooted and moved to Tokyo,

279
26:50.330 --> 26:54.200
it'll surely wither and die within three days.

280
26:54.200 --> 26:58.571
China's plants belong to Chinese soil.

281
27:27.720 --> 27:28.760
Father.

282
27:29.700 --> 27:31.640
With the North and South in a standoff,

283
27:31.640 --> 27:35.039
the Japanese want to exploit the situation to divide the country.

284
27:36.160 --> 27:40.640
No matter how careful we are when making deals with them,

285
27:41.320 --> 27:44.000
we could still end up inviting a wolf into our home.

286
27:44.000 --> 27:46.593
The Japanese are wolves that can never be tamed.

287
27:48.740 --> 27:53.240
But Chang Xuan, if you want to establish yourself,

288
27:53.240 --> 27:56.400
passion alone is far from enough.

289
27:57.320 --> 28:01.659
When Marshal Xu was in the Northeast, he dealt with the Japanese for years.

290
28:02.480 --> 28:04.359
He understood one principle.

291
28:04.359 --> 28:09.319
The Japanese guns and money can be accepted.

292
28:09.319 --> 28:12.940
They can be used as a temporary tool to turn their power against them.

293
28:12.940 --> 28:17.920
But we must make them understand what they can and cannot touch.

294
28:17.920 --> 28:21.699
If they cross the line, we'll fight to the death.

295
28:23.080 --> 28:27.459
We must use them, instead of being used.

296
28:31.080 --> 28:35.880
Marshal Xu's tactics are the ways of a ruthless leader.

297
28:35.880 --> 28:39.660
But what the Japanese want now is more than a few benefits.

298
28:41.200 --> 28:45.720
They want us to betray our country and cede territory as their subjects.

299
28:45.720 --> 28:50.841
If we grow powerful through their guns, we'll never truly stand tall.

300
28:51.680 --> 28:53.260
My stance is clear.

301
28:54.440 --> 28:59.080
We shouldn't accept any of their aid.

302
28:59.080 --> 29:01.900
The road is long, and things are complex.

303
29:02.880 --> 29:06.039
Don't be too absolute about anything.

304
29:06.039 --> 29:10.080
The bottom line... must be held.

305
29:11.680 --> 29:13.400
We mustn't yield an inch.

306
29:22.779 --> 29:24.019
Congratulations, Lady Ping Jun.

307
29:24.019 --> 29:25.720
You're indeed pregnant.

308
29:25.720 --> 29:27.680
It's been nearly two months.

309
29:27.680 --> 29:28.800
That's wonderful!

310
29:28.800 --> 29:32.080
If Master Chang Xuan finds out, he'll be overjoyed.

311
29:32.940 --> 29:34.600
The first three months are the most critical.

312
29:34.600 --> 29:35.840
Get plenty of rest.

313
29:35.840 --> 29:37.720
Avoid fatigue and emotional agitation.

314
29:37.720 --> 29:39.650
Keep your diet light as well.

315
29:39.650 --> 29:42.040
Avoid raw, cold, or greasy food.

316
29:42.040 --> 29:43.400
Thank you, Doctor.

317
29:43.400 --> 29:44.770
I'll keep all that in mind.

318
29:44.770 --> 29:46.610
Thank you, Doctor.

319
29:52.560 --> 29:53.760
Lady Ping Jun.

320
29:53.760 --> 29:58.060
Imagine how happy Master Chang Xuan will be if he finds out!

321
30:02.519 --> 30:04.700
Lady Ping Jun, are you alright?

322
30:05.440 --> 30:07.364
How are you driving?

323
30:07.364 --> 30:09.420
What's happening up ahead?

324
30:09.420 --> 30:11.000
A shop on the corner is on fire.

325
30:11.000 --> 30:13.660
The smoke is thick, and the road is blocked.

326
30:46.339 --> 30:47.880
Lady Ping Jun.

327
30:55.560 --> 30:57.444
Lady Ping Jun, are you alright?

328
30:57.444 --> 30:58.920
Lady Ping Jun, don't go over there.

329
30:58.920 --> 31:01.819
Don't scare me, Lady Ping Jun.

330
31:01.819 --> 31:03.733
Lady Ping Jun, don't scare me.

331
31:05.120 --> 31:06.240
Mother!

332
31:06.980 --> 31:08.299
Mother!

333
31:14.640 --> 31:15.819
Ping Jun.

334
31:17.039 --> 31:20.680
A soldier started the fire.

335
31:20.680 --> 31:22.159
A soldier?

336
31:28.619 --> 31:30.559
Why did you stop us again?

337
31:31.259 --> 31:33.460
Why did you leave without saying goodbye?

338
31:43.640 --> 31:44.880
Lady Ping Jun.

339
32:04.920 --> 32:06.046
Xiao Tang.

340
32:10.360 --> 32:12.080
- Let's go back. - Alright.

341
32:14.240 --> 32:17.153
Lady Ping Jun, aren't we going to the Headquarters?

342
32:21.320 --> 32:23.560
Xiao Tang. Promise me.

343
32:25.200 --> 32:31.440
Don't let anyone know about... my pregnancy.

344
32:31.440 --> 32:34.240
But it's such a big deal. I can't tell anyone?

345
32:35.400 --> 32:37.579
What about Master Chang Xuan?

346
32:44.319 --> 32:45.906
Especially not him.

347
32:47.080 --> 32:49.000
You absolutely cannot tell him.

348
32:52.480 --> 32:54.893
Promise me. I need you to promise me.

349
32:59.360 --> 33:01.940
Alright. I promise, Lady Ping Jun.

350
34:15.240 --> 34:17.273
Why did you suddenly start making this?

351
34:19.640 --> 34:22.097
You've had a lot on your mind lately.

352
34:22.097 --> 34:26.210
I want to string a bodhi bead bracelet to keep you safe and sound.

353
34:26.880 --> 34:27.880
Alright.

354
34:28.560 --> 34:32.693
Then I'll wear it day and night and never take it off.

355
34:34.860 --> 34:36.099
Stop it.

356
34:38.940 --> 34:40.679
I haven't finished it yet.

357
34:44.860 --> 34:46.039
What's wrong?

358
34:47.680 --> 34:48.860
Nothing.

359
34:54.240 --> 34:56.760
Did Qi Xuan upset you?

360
34:56.760 --> 35:00.800
Or... is Mother nagging about a baby?

361
35:04.440 --> 35:06.992
Qi Xuan has always been blunt.

362
35:06.992 --> 35:09.996
If she said something that bothered you,

363
35:09.996 --> 35:11.960
she meant well, but got it wrong.

364
35:11.960 --> 35:13.384
Don't be angry.

365
35:13.384 --> 35:17.064
As for having a child, I'll talk to Mother.

366
35:17.064 --> 35:18.640
We're still young.

367
35:18.640 --> 35:20.181
There's no rush.

368
35:21.200 --> 35:25.880
I don't want you to feel pressured at all.

369
35:30.560 --> 35:32.241
I can tell.

370
35:35.199 --> 35:40.840
When you hold Ze Ning, you can't hide the joy in your eyes.

371
35:47.519 --> 35:48.760
Ping Jun.

372
35:49.639 --> 35:50.920
Listen to me.

373
35:51.960 --> 35:57.793
To me, nothing is more important than your happiness.

374
37:38.760 --> 37:42.099
I'm the Commander of the 9th Corps, Yu Chang Xuan.

375
37:42.099 --> 37:46.320
No matter your grievances, they have nothing to do with this girl.

376
37:46.320 --> 37:47.599
Let her go.

377
37:48.280 --> 37:49.980
Take me instead.

378
37:49.980 --> 37:51.019
No!

379
37:55.600 --> 37:57.060
Yu Chang Xuan.

380
38:00.940 --> 38:03.079
You're here.

381
38:03.079 --> 38:04.320
I'm here.

382
38:06.320 --> 38:07.900
You're safe now.

383
38:09.900 --> 38:15.699
What's the point of bullying a helpless woman?

384
38:15.699 --> 38:17.260
Come at me instead.

385
38:20.460 --> 38:21.920
Yu Chang Xuan!

386
38:22.960 --> 38:25.159
Stop hitting him!

387
38:25.159 --> 38:26.800
Yu Chang Xuan!

388
38:27.680 --> 38:29.999
You're such a fool.

389
38:31.520 --> 38:34.517
I don't even remember anything.

390
38:34.517 --> 38:37.338
I don't deserve this.

391
38:41.639 --> 38:42.840
Ping Jun.

392
38:44.219 --> 38:46.599
To me...

393
38:46.599 --> 38:48.520
I can walk now.

394
38:48.520 --> 38:51.160
Nothing is more important than your happiness.

395
39:56.900 --> 39:58.019
There.

396
39:58.880 --> 40:01.599
It's still early. Get some more sleep.

397
40:10.120 --> 40:11.401
Chang Xuan.

398
40:12.880 --> 40:14.020
Yes?

399
40:16.760 --> 40:18.039
Nothing.

400
40:19.480 --> 40:21.020
Remember to eat breakfast.

401
40:22.040 --> 40:23.480
I will.

402
40:23.480 --> 40:24.833
Wait for me to come back.

403
40:30.199 --> 40:31.800
Yu Chang Xuan.

404
40:33.119 --> 40:38.440
Whether it was you... doesn't matter anymore.

405
40:40.720 --> 40:46.086
All of this began when our paths crossed.

406
40:48.260 --> 40:50.519
Since it was a mistake,

407
40:52.539 --> 40:54.599
let's end it here.

408
41:14.040 --> 41:16.073
Lady Ping Jun, I'll get fresh water.

409
41:35.520 --> 41:36.739
Mother.

410
41:55.780 --> 41:57.380
It's cold out.

411
41:57.380 --> 41:59.099
Don't catch a chill.

412
42:00.840 --> 42:02.300
I know.

413
42:39.640 --> 42:41.100
Careful, it's hot.

414
42:51.960 --> 42:53.393
Lady Ping Jun.

415
42:56.019 --> 42:57.440
Lady Ping Jun.

416
42:58.120 --> 42:59.493
What's wrong?

417
43:05.233 --> 43:06.520
Nothing.

418
43:06.520 --> 43:07.860
Who upset you?

419
43:07.860 --> 43:09.820
Tell me. I'll go teach them a lesson.

420
43:11.760 --> 43:13.600
Except for Master Chang Xuan.

421
43:16.800 --> 43:21.480
Think carefully before you speak.

422
43:21.480 --> 43:23.920
Don't always be so impulsive.

423
43:23.920 --> 43:26.266
Lest you offend someone unknowingly.

424
43:26.266 --> 43:28.711
With you looking out for me, I'm not afraid.

425
43:32.080 --> 43:34.620
I can't look out for you forever.

426
43:36.260 --> 43:41.480
In this world, who can really take care of anyone forever?

427
43:52.240 --> 43:53.273
Let me.

428
43:54.780 --> 43:58.179
Let's drop the formalities today. Just two friends talking.

429
44:00.000 --> 44:04.159
Xue Ting, I want to know your honest thoughts.

430
44:04.940 --> 44:09.400
What do you think about the current government?

431
44:10.260 --> 44:11.880
The government today...

432
44:14.380 --> 44:18.059
is like a ship riddled with holes.

433
44:18.059 --> 44:22.619
It looks massive, but it's plagued by infighting and rampant corruption.

434
44:22.619 --> 44:26.420
At the slightest storm, it will fall apart.

435
44:27.200 --> 44:32.619
Then we are of like mind.

436
44:33.579 --> 44:37.866
But... aren't you a general of the Central Government?

437
44:39.120 --> 44:42.060
I've been on the central ship for far too long.

438
44:43.400 --> 44:46.760
Where it leaks and where it's about to break,

439
44:46.760 --> 44:48.880
I know better than anyone.

440
44:49.619 --> 44:53.960
That's why one must have more than one path.

441
44:55.940 --> 45:00.119
You mean the Southern Government?

442
45:03.400 --> 45:07.780
Walking on two legs is always steadier than walking on one.

443
45:11.500 --> 45:12.920
But it's difficult.

444
45:13.719 --> 45:17.760
Why would they accept former Central Government officials like us?

445
45:17.760 --> 45:19.160
Even if they did,

446
45:19.160 --> 45:24.880
we'll find it hard to secure high positions.

447
45:24.880 --> 45:30.000
That's why I want to introduce a friend to you.

448
45:33.579 --> 45:34.840
Please, come in.

449
45:38.300 --> 45:41.706
Mr. Jiang, I've heard so much about you.

450
45:47.860 --> 45:49.460
You're home early today.

451
45:49.460 --> 45:51.320
Just in time for dinner.

452
45:51.320 --> 45:54.660
Yes. Mother made you walnut and pork rib soup again.

453
45:56.400 --> 45:57.504
Where is Ping Jun?

454
45:57.504 --> 46:00.820
Auntie Zhu, go call Lady Ping Jun for dinner.

455
46:00.820 --> 46:03.920
Madam, she went to the old house in Dongshanqiao.

456
46:03.920 --> 46:05.359
She hasn't returned yet.

457
46:06.360 --> 46:08.500
- The old house? - Yes.

458
46:08.500 --> 46:13.539
- Why did she go there? - This is bad! Lady Ping Jun is missing!

459
46:13.539 --> 46:15.086
What do you mean, missing?

460
46:16.639 --> 46:18.420
Lady Ping Jun said... she...

461
46:18.420 --> 46:20.860
Speak clearly. Didn't you say she went to the old house?

462
46:20.860 --> 46:22.320
How can she be missing?

463
46:22.320 --> 46:25.239
She was meeting a friend at the Guangfu Teahouse.

464
46:25.239 --> 46:26.460
She said she'd be out in an hour.

465
46:26.460 --> 46:29.079
But we waited for two hours, and she never came out.

466
46:29.079 --> 46:30.640
I just went inside to ask around.

467
46:30.640 --> 46:33.800
The staff said they hadn't seen her today.

468
46:33.800 --> 46:36.040
Meeting a friend?

469
46:36.040 --> 46:38.446
She doesn't remember anything. What friend could she have?

470
46:40.039 --> 46:41.853
What exactly happened these past days?

471
46:42.800 --> 46:43.960
Speak!

472
46:44.800 --> 46:50.000
Lady Ping Jun felt unwell that day, so we went to the hospital.

473
46:50.000 --> 46:54.239
The doctor told us the wonderful news that she was pregnant.

474
46:55.596 --> 46:57.560
She was so happy.

475
46:57.560 --> 46:59.804
She said she must tell Master Chang Xuan.

476
46:59.804 --> 47:02.360
But on our way back, we saw a huge fire.

477
47:02.360 --> 47:04.897
She seemed to be in shock.

478
47:04.897 --> 47:10.320
I don't know why, but she ordered me not to tell anyone about the pregnancy.

479
47:10.320 --> 47:12.506
Especially not Master Chang Xuan.

480
47:18.080 --> 47:19.600
Chang Xuan!

481
47:19.600 --> 47:20.654
Mother.

482
48:01.000 --> 48:04.780
Our time together has been like a grand dream.

483
48:04.780 --> 48:07.679
Now, it is time to wake.

484
48:07.679 --> 48:13.199
The truth of my mother's tragic death weighs upon me like a mountain.

485
48:13.199 --> 48:16.420
All the evidence points to one conclusion.

486
48:16.420 --> 48:20.440
I don't want to believe it, but I can no longer deceive myself.

487
48:21.119 --> 48:23.400
For both you and me,

488
48:24.239 --> 48:29.699
it is better to part ways than remain entangled by the wrong fate.

489
48:30.280 --> 48:32.080
I only ask for one thing.

490
48:32.080 --> 48:35.741
Please, show mercy, and do not look for me.
